      "mergeID": "5fae0823c2b95a087e379cf8",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The MediaPlayer component of AvProVideo allows for low latency streaming by enabling \"UseLowLatency\".\nWe can use the VRCAVProVideoPlayer component of SDK3 to use AVProVideo in our world. However, there is no option to enable \"UseLowLatency\".\nI would like to add a feature that allows this option to be set.",
